/// the catalog has to carry them. But their spellings are `X`, `Y`, `AREA`,
/// `CONTAINS`, `EQUALS`, `OVERLAPS`, `WITHIN`, `BUFFER` — the most ordinary
/// column names there are — and MariaDB itself documents every one as a synonym
